   "definitions": [
    {
     "definition": "A rare gastrointestinal tract sarcoma with neuroectodermal differentiation characterized by the presence of neoplastic round cells with pale eosinophilic cytoplasm. Cytoplasmic clearing is seen only in a minority of cases. Half of the cases contain osteoclastic giant cells. It is associated with gene fusion translocations involving the EWSR1 gene, usually EWSR1-ATF1 fusion or EWSR1-CREB1 fusion.",
     "code": "P97",
